--- .gitignore (原始)
```
# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Build outputs
dist/
build/
target/

# TypeScript/JavaScript
*.js.map
*.tsbuildinfo

# Environment variables
.env
.env.local
*.env.*

# IDE files
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# Logs
*.log

# Temporary files
*.tmp

# Coverage reports
coverage/
htmlcov/
*.coverage

# Python related (in case Python files are added later)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.Python
env/
venv/
.venv/
pip-log.txt
pip-delete-this-directory.txt
.tox/
.coverage
.nyc_output
istanbul*
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.hypothesis/

# OS generated files
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
```

+++ .gitignore (修改后)
```
# Compressed files
*.zip

# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Environment
.env
.env.local
.env.*

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/

# Logs and temp files
*.log
*.tmp

# Build artifacts
dist/
build/
target/

# Python specific
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd

# Java specific
*.class
*.jar
*.war
*.ear

# C/C++ specific
*.o
*.obj
*.a
*.lib
*.so
*.dll
*.dylib
*.exe

# Go specific
*.exe
*.test

# Node.js specific
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Ruby specific
*.gem
*.rbc
coverage/
*.sqlite3

# Other common ignores
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
```